*POSSESS - Possess a monster

Syntax: *possess <creature> [number]

Requires the native caretaker/DM class and an eligible monster in the room.
Permanent monsters and other invalid targets are refused by the original
engine. This is the legacy possession system, not hdm teleport. Scoped hdm
teleports refuse possessed characters. Read the game responses for the
possession state; this command does not assign staff or builder permissions.
